        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "One might argue the Q4 deceleration is overstated because the earlier advance estimate showed 2.9 percent, narrowing the Q3-to-Q4 gap to 0.3 percentage points; however, the second estimate's more complete data support the 2.7 percent figure, and no source disputes that revision.",
